Hydrosphere.explanation:
Benthic deposits contain substances derived 
from algae and mostly exist in the form of liquid mud, 
known as ooze (Indus mud).

Economic Geography.explanation:
The correct order of topographical sheets 
from large scale to small scale is: 
63K/7/2 → 47D/11 → 55V → 63.

Indian Geography.explanation:
The correct sequence of the Himalayan ranges 
from south to north is: 
Pir Panjal → Zanskar → Ladakh → Karakoram

Rajmahal (Jharkhand), Adilabad (Andhra 
Pradesh), and Ratnagiri (Maharashtra) have iron ore; 
Anantagiri does not.
